{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:82b1808f5fa07694e411a010836226cd0777b94ff473133c78cd12ae7e45156c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73f0d0f8e4f9e7a668c0435ebdab4ee13453a112b751b5cd9ec2a826d6131cec",
      "text": "想要展示给您看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b4ad438a76a22766be6df50ca0a1e983e2629625f6df7995d82fdc605072075",
      "text": "最近不知为何频繁往海边跑的克里斯。\n感到奇怪的制作人询问原因后，\n克里斯认为与其说明情况不如亲眼所见，\n于是邀请制作人前往海边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73f0d0f8e4f9e7a668c0435ebdab4ee13453a112b751b5cd9ec2a826d6131cec",
      "text": "想要展示给您看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fb305ca43063ef41ea460b38128c05bb4a22445afdd74063f3ea4797ac8af48",
      "text": "（这几天，克里斯先生的衣着打扮稍微有点奇怪。\n发生什么事了吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0bccbe65793e3b574636ba2eb078a1fdc33a2abea4b0fd654a7a80abe2e3cd2",
      "text": "克里斯先生……难道说，您最近一直都是\n从海边直接来事务所的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb00bd6f2556e02d8930bba33d3c4f17a8aa87326c0c0d70f014baec0a36a6d",
      "text": "您看出来了啊！我今天也是露宿野外的。\n莫非，您也能感受到大海的力量了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:427f03b99f2011409e0c1dd35465743336f6f980917acfa736343ba4ba46ea49",
      "text": "不，是因为克里斯先生的头发上有沙子。\n而且潜水服上还粘着裙带菜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8202679903d8563c4c9968717f01cbb741d8ebf6801e6cc1fc609c56b481309e",
      "text": "哎呀，我还以为已经清理干净了呢……\n这可真是失礼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f1d0a4b66baad30ac1d98c48314bd781e43a9737acc8b3ceaa1ea800deeef4",
      "text": "像这样连续多日在海边过夜还真少见呢。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84cdd31dc82621ba018c54188d4122372d09a9dd82291d184c16a8470f22c337",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:671a6a2c51a2f444fd70e6c450c0976ef1f939cb7323455792d4b88ee812e438",
      "text": "在这里很难解释清楚……\n与其说是难解释，不如说我认为不应该在这里说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19f2a95be4f59dddff31ebb373f2a6fd08fdb7cc03046de948401e32daaa109c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n您傍晚的日程安排如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:970a2908232b711a4ac1555bb106ae9bfa1177383acc3179addb8fd852b0d976",
      "text": "我有一件东西，想要展示给您看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff1972bfa50d454d3aa77c29c8dd93590495fa2014bef752dfe20fa12563acaf",
      "text": "（工作结束后，我被克里斯先生带到了\n海边）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:021cb91093d54064aa830b1454cde643f835f9738b259c5d3259f78d71d191c8",
      "text": "总算是赶在日落前到达了呢。\n啊啊，美丽的夕阳正照耀着海面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde162bc876384f9c9cf1e3457ea5018752d6cd76bd5c138712467c57f454a2f",
      "text": "真的呢……！\n想让我看的东西，就是这片大海吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cc4e1cdcaafa6db64bacc3ec9f0e49ab7fea0ed2e15589347967f57e97909ca",
      "text": "不，接下来要给您看的，\n是更为稀有的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89b29a6880ace7c149e5fa3286e2c3117ddb68b998c34a5175ac9c0ea80e3689",
      "text": "我一直在观察时机，\n如果是今天的话，大概……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ca395121facb23d0bb343429400d9118d0deff71ce7d380d287605717db6d0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n请跟我来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b44db9b95ffb7de186c8dc01c26d7ae424910b98c2537b796de14eef09169c",
      "text": "从这里开始，严禁大声交谈。\n脚步声也要尽可能不要响起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6208b1bdbd1243c5b6ae543cbec59d61723f17c1c15eaa0b7c081b94acdf319",
      "text": "为了不惊吓到她们，\n我们要付出最细致的注意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fcbf997f165e7efb80512cc210ba1cf96dc5d19ed3620f7d25edaf1223fd4f3",
      "text": "她们……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0048613e77c46f85e9e68cdfb64ddd73297e561cf982cd19172c6245f73b996",
      "text": "是的。\n是美丽而又强大的生物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac1977482575b895b66a4a928e27bdd143b9102ba8d06adc8bf767d64b8cf3c",
      "text": "克里斯先生，快看。\n今天好像是满月呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f6f4ee64b0b8c0148d3adc22a29ecd8326bd2c7e62753d060a2e30d5278d0cc",
      "text": "是的。\n真的挑了个最合适的好日子来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b0fae0ece5d74c631a185c0fbf378bcaebca3951b2400b325bc172e7e22ca0c",
      "text": "咦……比起刚才，\n涌上来的浪花退得更远了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b07569f753c53c73bb207231068bf5e8ed79bb9890f37c432e3aa6e54b5e028",
      "text": "满月的夜晚被称为大潮，\n潮起潮落的水位差会变得非常巨大。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22fc7adfaa91d3a86c16f5f148625eece426d53500bd7ac36697d0e5ba43bdbc",
      "text": "大海虽然身处地球，\n却也在受到月球的影响……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9500394ded1975517c7d90f3f23a79cb5c2bd3839d201e01ad20abab51410210",
      "text": "它不仅连接着生活在陆地上的人与人，\n与宇宙也是息息相关的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4be5e13d9ec9da8341ac0cc5873bab4affb235eb1a47ad7c4e9ac65dd1bff409",
      "text": "我想，她们差不多\n也该过来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d450a7cf34c64095d4a3b827f50a45c7acdbda5c03ae8998d49724ffeddba91",
      "text": "……啊。\n克里斯先生，那个难道是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534211c41c7df7c39f70e2d199cbd9615f5fd28b1945ea14a99a8832902d3d94",
      "text": "……啊啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n被您发现了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c36b9e9cd882dfd0a06e8a2d1c42700c456b1a41fbf5d0dec58803eb6006935",
      "text": "海龟的一生都在海中度过。但是，\n前来产卵的她们会像这样爬上陆地。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2c1b7febcc86ed0c622fce7dc631753c3551b8fe4e076f9b0e5a14c98dbb5d0",
      "text": "为了不惊动海龟，\n我们躲在暗处静静守望吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000009:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eb81daf3e8b464899d7279eedb5209c0fe4e602e3334ab22412d7b9a3071fce",
      "text": "海龟慢慢地花费了许多时间，\n在沙滩地产下了大量的卵",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:475e31fd3cff526c9a50d5214f531ec2b9b4d58bff04ea357c8a9bc2d8cea00c",
      "text": "海龟回去了呢。\n真是神秘而庄严的光景……克里斯先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bdeb755fa8201c6cd4760ab7b897a4cd829647eaf0cbb3402401da09e611b65",
      "text": "哈啊……太美妙了！无论看多少次都会感动不已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faa2f8ec302f28fdab860ab4524679b8abc884661246c08dff6be0c9a5d332b0",
      "text": "海龟在出生后不久便会启程前往遥远的大洋，\n等到产卵之时，又会重新回到故乡。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d2444151b09ed2c2278fbb0b3a9dad9b9b29beb375af96814fec01552aa30ff",
      "text": "正如海龟妈妈那样，今天产下的\n孩子们，有朝一日也会回到这里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8370dd42b0e27f1f54b64d6cff249ce7fe6078c6e6256e4179c1fef01704589",
      "text": "这是从遥远、遥远的古老过去不断重复至今的，\n生命的循环。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b00b545b10367d204e9025db4dc2e9460ac6b42c85dd774bd0603c5147927",
      "text": "我之所以频繁往海边跑，\n寻找产卵的时机……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9efa26889d6c2084390e6b6a0af71fd8cb802f220808ed1e65d9ae7ff6004f5f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。是因为我无论如何，\n都想让您亲眼看看这幅景象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d32d9f9f181cc7c507466293f4e0770b1de1eea18c99f6d52fd44a5f757b4d37",
      "text": "能看到这么美好的景象，我很高兴。\n……但是，为什么是我呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe02e59c24f9e905ee4e639344dbcfbe86f7439397c463748410fa46d5587bd2",
      "text": "……对于●●●●プロデューサー的\n感谢之情，我无论如何都想传达给您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea9f0e8679c37c045b9268f68639a05d83e5638d85662b28a710d8813d979a68",
      "text": "成为偶像之后，我\n从您那里学到了许多许多事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fd2628058356f3389b3f36d4eaf668b31f0ab4b56a4ad5906aea7c5b92e7376",
      "text": "我一直在思考该以怎样的方式，\n来传达日常的这份感激之情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:477318b40fd9392d2313562dee87d56fbbbb9a4cd1b12981d5cb47a15cd28c00",
      "text": "于是我想到了，如果是美丽而充满力量的海龟产卵，\n一定能够让您感到开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7684cc43440067944a2b5052a4af4fee1c5ecbe29611148b1a3c5ffae5768e8e",
      "text": "感觉如何呢，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我的心意，传达给您了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:189a5324e01e4c6e9bac82df7d6c1762d1b6d104f3022a46f8e945ca65dc529a",
      "text": "那当然了。\n克里斯先生感激的心情，我充分体会到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f494ef1a1ae690d42406383209bb783bf2f06a94f80d36bd2a5ecb7e76de5b4",
      "text": "那就再好不过了。\n能带您来这里，真的太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e770559bbf81857d95fe964ce80fe4d158cd98321d3768fbe74c6f041f48e0",
      "text": "呵呵。\n……啊，已经这个时间了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb7372b5a1c9feddef14db09955588e3beec6ebc19404a017a220f7ddc952b28",
      "text": "那么，趁着天色还不算太晚……\n我们来做露宿野外的准备吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b097d493095fe33b5fd56cb845c558e0b7a222dd98c9b46b462e7f960016c849",
      "text": "不行，今天得回家。\n请好好休息，明天还有工作哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5151fd4b4c9f4551307e1ba874f0e8092328c275549917787a81d083be111105",
      "text": "哎呀，伴着潮声入眠也是非常美妙的\n体验呢……那么，就留到将来的某一天吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
